.SH NAME
md_frontend_2node__modules_2js-yaml_2_c_h_a_n_g_e_l_o_g \- Changelog 
.PP


.PP
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file\&.

.PP
The format is based on \fRKeep a Changelog\fP, and this project adheres to \fRSemantic Versioning\fP\&.
.SH "\fR4\&.1\&.0\fP - 2021-04-15"
.PP
.SS "Added"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Types are now exported as \fRyaml\&.types\&.XXX\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Every type now has \fRoptions\fP property with original arguments kept as they were (see \fRyaml\&.types\&.int\&.options\fP as an example)\&.
.PP
.SS "Changed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRSchema\&.extend()\fP now keeps old type order in case of conflicts (e\&.g\&. Schema\&.extend([ a, b, c ])\&.extend([ b, a, d ]) is now ordered as \fRabcd\fP instead of \fRcbad\fP)\&.
.PP
.SH "\fR4\&.0\&.0\fP - 2021-01-03"
.PP
.SS "Changed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Check \fBmigration guide\fP to see details for all breaking changes\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Breaking: "unsafe" tags \fR!!js/function\fP, \fR!!js/regexp\fP, \fR!!js/undefined\fP are moved to \fRjs-yaml-js-types\fP package\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Breaking: removed \fRsafe*\fP functions\&. Use \fRload\fP, \fRloadAll\fP, \fRdump\fP instead which are all now safe by default\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRyaml\&.DEFAULT_SAFE_SCHEMA\fP and \fRyaml\&.DEFAULT_FULL_SCHEMA\fP are removed, use \fRyaml\&.DEFAULT_SCHEMA\fP instead\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRyaml\&.Schema\&.create(schema, tags)\fP is removed, use \fRschema\&.extend(tags)\fP instead\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fR!!binary\fP now always mapped to \fRUint8Array\fP on load\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Reduced nesting of \fR/lib\fP folder\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Parse numbers according to YAML 1\&.2 instead of YAML 1\&.1 (\fR01234\fP is now decimal, \fR0o1234\fP is octal, \fR1:23\fP is parsed as string instead of base60)\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRdump()\fP no longer quotes \fR:\fP, \fR[\fP, \fR]\fP, \fR(\fP, \fR)\fP except when necessary, #470, #557\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Line and column in exceptions are now formatted as \fR(X:Y)\fP instead of \fRat line X, column Y\fP (also present in compact format), #332\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Code snippet created in exceptions now contains multiple lines with line numbers\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRdump()\fP now serializes \fRundefined\fP as \fRnull\fP in collections and removes keys with \fRundefined\fP in mappings, #571\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRdump()\fP with \fRskipInvalid=true\fP now serializes invalid items in collections as null\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Custom tags starting with \fR!\fP are now dumped as \fR!tag\fP instead of \fR!<!tag>\fP, #576\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Custom tags starting with \fRtag:yaml\&.org,2002:\fP are now shorthanded using \fR!!\fP, #258\&.
.PP
.SS "Added"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fR\&.mjs\fP (es modules) support\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRquotingType\fP and \fRforceQuotes\fP options for dumper to configure string literal style, #290, #529\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRstyles: { '!!null': 'empty' }\fP option for dumper (serializes \fR{ foo: null }\fP as "`foo: `"), #570\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRreplacer\fP option (similar to option in JSON\&.stringify), #339\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Custom \fRTag\fP can now handle all tags or multiple tags with the same prefix, #385\&.
.PP
.SS "Fixed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Astral characters are no longer encoded by \fRdump()\fP, #587\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
"duplicate mapping key" exception now points at the correct column, #452\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Extra commas in flow collections (e\&.g\&. \fR[foo,,bar]\fP) now throw an exception instead of producing null, #321\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fR__proto__\fP key no longer overrides object prototype, #164\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Removed \fRbower\&.json\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Tags are now url-decoded in \fRload()\fP and url-encoded in \fRdump()\fP (previously usage of custom non-ascii tags may have led to invalid YAML that can't be parsed)\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Anchors now work correctly with empty nodes, #301\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix incorrect parsing of invalid block mapping syntax, #418\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Throw an error if block sequence/mapping indent contains a tab, #80\&.
.PP
